notes.content:
Improved issue with ghost parts during dismemberment, still needs more polish;
Fixed issue where bed doesn't appear;
Characters can now get out of spikes more easily.

Added fire damage;
Added Molotov Cocktail;
Added fire trap.

It is now possible to select the initial position of the camera on maps;
Fixed the issue with blocks without textures;
Spawners now use the new weapons.

Minor performance improvements and bug fixes;
Added function to make any NPC immortal;
Added function to make any NPC super strong;
